#: src/optimizers/opt_fitness.c:320
msgid ""
"Score = (max(v − t, 0) / √(t² + 1))<sup>exp</sup> + τ / (1 + max(t − v, 0) / "
"√(t² + 1))\n"
"Penalizes values above target; score approaches zero below target"
msgstr ""
"Score = (max(v − t, 0) / √(t² + 1))<sup>exp</sup> + τ / (1 + max(t − v, 0) / "
"√(t² + 1))\n"
"목표값을 초과하면 벌점을 부과하며, 목표값보다 낮으면 점수가 0에 가까워집니다."

#: src/optimizers/opt_fitness.c:324
msgid ""
"Score = (max(t − v, 0) / √(t² + 1))<sup>exp</sup> + τ / (1 + max(v − t, 0) / "
"√(t² + 1))\n"
"Penalizes values below target; score approaches zero above target"
msgstr ""
"Score = (max(t − v, 0) / √(t² + 1))<sup>exp</sup> + τ / (1 + max(v − t, 0) / "
"√(t² + 1))\n"
"목표값보다 낮으면 벌점을 부과하며, 목표값보다 높으면 점수가 0에 가까워집니다."

#: src/optimizers/opt_fitness.c:328
msgid ""
"Score = |value − target|<sup>exp</sup>\n"
"Penalizes deviation from target; score=0 when value = target"
msgstr ""
"Score = |value − target|<sup>exp</sup>\n"
"목표값에서 벗어나면 벌점을 부과합니다. value = target이면 score=0입니다."

#: src/optimizers/opt_fitness.c:335
